      "contents": "Career Objective [cite_start]To secure a professional role as a Mobile Application Developer or Software Developer where I can apply my technical expertise, contribute to innovative projects, and continue growing as a technology professional while delivering high-quality digital solutions[cite: 89, 90].\nProfessional Summary [cite_start]I am a highly motivated and detail-oriented mobile and software application developer with strong practical skills in Java, Kotlin, and Python[cite: 35, 39]. [cite_start]I have hands-on experience designing, developing, and testing mobile and web-based applications with a focus on usability, performance, and clean logic[cite: 40, 50].\n[cite_start]Alongside development, I am an experienced Prompt Engineer, with a deep understanding of how to structure effective prompts for artificial intelligence systems to achieve accurate and reliable outputs[cite: 41]. [cite_start]I am passionate about continuous learning, problem-solving, and building meaningful digital products that create real-world value[cite: 42].\n",
